.TH "pipewire-pulse" 1 "1.6.8" "PipeWire" \" -*- nroff -*-
.ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pipewire-pulse \- The PipeWire PulseAudio replacement

.PP
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP

.PP
\fBpipewire-pulse\fP [\fIoptions\fP]

.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP

.PP
\fBpipewire-pulse\fP starts a PulseAudio-compatible daemon that integrates with the PipeWire media server, by running a pipewire process through a systemd service\&. This daemon is a drop-in replacement for the PulseAudio daemon\&.

.PP
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP

.PP
\fB-h | --help\fP
.RS 4
Show help\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB-v | --verbose\fP
.RS 4
Increase the verbosity by one level\&. This option may be specified multiple times\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB--version\fP
.RS 4
Show version information\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB-c | --config=FILE\fP
.RS 4
Load the given config file (Default: pipewire-pulse\&.conf)\&.
.RE
.PP
.SH "ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES"
.PP

.PP
The generic \fBpipewire(1) environment variables\fP are supported\&.

.PP
In addition:

.PP
\fBPULSE_RUNTIME_PATH \fP
.RS 4

.RE
.PP
\fBXDG_RUNTIME_DIR \fP
.RS 4
Directory where to create the native protocol pulseaudio socket\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBPULSE_LATENCY_MSEC \fP
.RS 4
Extra buffering latency in milliseconds\&. This controls buffering logic in \fRlibpulse\fP and may be set for PulseAudio client applications to adjust their buffering\&. (Setting it on the \fRpipewire-pulse\fP server has no effect\&.)
.RE
.PP
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP

.PP
The PipeWire Developers <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/pipewire/pipewire/issues>; PipeWire is available from <https://pipewire.org>

.PP
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP

.PP
\fBpipewire-pulse\&.conf(5)\fP, \fBpipewire(1)\fP, \fBpipewire-pulse-modules(7)\fP 

